        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/perspective/20260428-french-far-right-definitely-can-win-2027-presidential-vote-journalist-victor-mallet",
        "orario": "15:28",
        "timestamp": 1777382916,
        "contenuto_esteso": "\"Far-right France\" is the title of a panel discussion being held this Tuesday at the American Library in Paris. The panel will talk about the past, present and future of France's far-right movements, exactly one year head of crucial French presidential elections for which the far right is riding high in the polls. But can it actually go all the way and win? We put that question to one of the panelists, Victor Mallet, who is senior editor at the Financial Times and author of \"Far-right France: Le Pen, Bardella and the Future of Europe\"."
